<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/24/eng@/~cl_15__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by deleting the definitions of \"credit facility\", \"depositor\", \"fund manager\", \"licensee\" and \"trust company\"; and ( c ) by inserting after the definition of \"licensed offshore bank\" the following definitions: ' \"police officer\" means any member of the Royal Malaysia Police as defined in the Police Act 1967 [Act 344]; \"property\" means- ( a ) assets of every kind, whether corporeal or incorporeal, moveable or immoveable, tangible or intangible, however acquired; and ( b ) legal documents or instruments in any form evidencing title to or interest in the assets referred to in paragraph ( a ) , including bank cheques, money orders, shares, securities, bonds, drafts and letters of credit.'. Amendment of section 28B"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/24/eng@> .
