<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/24/eng@/~cl_19> <https://schema.org/name> "Section 28D of the principal Act is amended-"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/24/eng@> .
