<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/24/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 1 of the principal Act is amended by deleting the word \"Offshore\". Amendment of section 2"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/24/eng@> .
